<title>CHINA: Shanghai Posts 1996 net down 12.02 pct.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Posts 1996 net down 12.02 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover		234.847	 vs	231.609</p>
<p> Net profit	     46.694	 vs	 53.074</p>
<p> Asset per share    3.10  yuan     vs     2.88 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share  0.32 yuan     vs     0.36 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Posts and Telecommunications Equipment Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Note: the results were released in a company statement on Monday. The numbers are based on domestic accounting standards. Figures based on international accounting standards were not available.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors proposed a cash dividend of 0.10 yuan per share, pending approval of a shareholders meeting. the statement said.</p>
</text>
